sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant Tray as kiro-tray agent
    participant Env as .env file
    participant Compose as docker compose
    participant API as kiro-api container

    User->>Tray: click "Change Port…"
    Tray->>User: prompt for new port (tkinter)
    User-->>Tray: 8790
    Tray->>Env: rewrite KIRO_API_PORT=8790 (comments preserved)
    Tray->>Compose: docker compose up -d
    Compose->>API: recreate container on new port
    API-->>Tray: /health OK on :8790
    Tray->>Tray: refresh menu + status dot
    Tray-->>User: notify "Applied"
